/target

# Rust
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Python fixtures used for local hardware smoke tests
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Model weights and demo artifacts — too large for git, reproducible from upstream
*.pt
*.onnx
*.gguf
*.engine
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.tflite

# Local demo inputs captured during recording
*.mp4
*.gif
# Exception: demo assets under docs/ are intentional
!docs/**/*.gif
!docs/**/*.mp4

# Editor / OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store

# Runtime state — audit logs and any locally-generated config
edge_monitor.toml
audit.log

# v1.3.2 / DISPATCH 108 ITEM 5 — session investigation dirs under
# tests/empirical/ that use a date-suffix naming convention (e.g.
# `activity_feed_empty_2026-06-08/`, `each_key_audit_2026-06-08/`)
# are transient — evidence captured for one investigation, not
# meant to accumulate in git. Historical evidence dirs (versioned
# `v1_x_y/` prefixes) stay tracked; this pattern only catches the
# `<something>_YYYY-MM-DD/` shape at the tests/empirical/ ROOT
# (deeper `run-store/runs/2026-XX-XX/` fixtures inside tracked
# gates aren't matched — the pattern is anchored to direct
# children of tests/empirical/).
/tests/empirical/*_2026-*/
/tests/empirical/*_2027-*/

# Scratch log from local web-companion runs
scratch_web.log

# Local hardware fixtures at repo root (not meant to be committed or packaged)
/bus.jpg
/q.py
/yolo_loop.py
install_docs*.sh
.elevenlabs_key
